    "description": {
      "value": "You cultivate four wooden bulbs, each filled with toxic pollen and sensitive to motion. When a creature enters a space adjacent to a bulb, or when a bulb is touched or damaged (each bulb has AC 5), the bulb blossoms and releases pollen in a 15-foot emanation. Creatures in the area take 8d8 poison damage and must attempt a Fortitude save with the following results.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The creature is unaffected.\n- **Success:** The creature takes half damage and becomes dazzled for 1 round.\n- **Failure:** The creature takes full damage, becomes dazzled for 1 round, and becomes stupefied 1 for 1 minute.\n- **Critical Failure:** The creature takes double damage, is dazzled for 1 round, and becomes stupefied 2 for 1 minute."
    },
    "higher_level_description": {
      "value": "Heightened (+1): The damage increases by 2d8."
    },
